Adapt OpenTUI build.zig for Zig 0.16.0 (lang/zig on OpenBSD).

15 API migrations needed for the Zig 0.15→0.16 stdlib and
build-system overhaul:

  nativeExecutableTarget  b.graph.host.query → b.host
  pathExists              std.fs.cwd() removed → stub (macOS only)
  isMacOSSDKPath           std.mem.trimRight removed → manual slice
  resolveMacOSSDKPath      b.graph.env_map → b.graph.environ_map
  SUPPORTED_ZIG_VERSIONS   add 0.16.0
  macOS SDK detection      drop removed darwin.isSdkInstalled

  addIncludePath           → artifact.root_module.addIncludePath
  addCSourceFile           → artifact.root_module.addCSourceFile
  addSystemIncludePath     → artifact.root_module.addSystemIncludePath
  addSystemFrameworkPath   → artifact.root_module.addSystemFrameworkPath
  addFrameworkPath         → artifact.root_module.addFrameworkPath
  addLibraryPath           → artifact.root_module.addLibraryPath
  linkLibC()               → artifact.root_module.link_libc = true
  linkFramework(name)      → artifact.root_module.linkFramework(name, .{})
  linkSystemLibrary(name)  → artifact.root_module.linkSystemLibrary(name, .{})

The vendored uucode dependency (0.1.0) uses @Type and
std.time.Instant, both removed in Zig 0.16.  Override with a
newer uucode that targets 0.16, or patch the vendored copy
manually.  Pass --system uucode=/path/to/patched/uucode.

